	)
	(text "Each PWR_FLAG below sits on one supply net, reached through a global label with the name of the power symbol ST uses.\nThe flag tells KiCad ERC that the net is driven: these nets are fed by regulators, power switches, ferrite beads\nor connectors, whose pins are not of type power output. The flags add no parts and do not change the netlist."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 29.21 0)
